<title>USA: IHOP Corp January same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>IHOP Corp January same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDALE, Calif 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>IHOP Corp, the operators of International House of Pancakes restaurants, said Thursday that same store sales for the fiscal month of January were up 4 percent, compared to a decrease of 0.4 percent in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company did not provide dollar figures.</p>
